{"id":"83dfbde66bc78255","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-partial-order.md","title":"Partial Order","display":"df-partial-order — Partial Order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-partial-order","aliases":["58-df-partial-order"],"display":"df-partial-order — Partial Order","depends_on":["[[58-df-relation]]","[[58-df-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-partial-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-partial-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-partial-order — Partial Order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7ccfc8c88f29968a\" href=\"?note=7ccfc8c88f29968a\" title=\"58-df-relation\">58-df-relation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P \\in V\">\\(P \\in V\\)</span> (underlying set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le\">\\(\\le\\)</span> (binary relation on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartOrd}(P, \\le)\">\\(\\mathrm{PartOrd}(P, \\le)\\)</span> (defined here; 偏序谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}order} \\vdash \\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,\\le) \\leftrightarrow \\le\\,\\subseteq P\\times P\\land(\\forall p\\in P\\,(p\\le p))\\land(\\forall p,q\\in P\\,(p\\le q\\land q\\le p\\to p=q))\\land(\\forall p,q,r\\in P\\,(p\\le q\\land q\\le r\\to p\\le r))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}order} \\vdash \\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,\\le) \\leftrightarrow \\le\\,\\subseteq P\\times P\\land(\\forall p\\in P\\,(p\\le p))\\land(\\forall p,q\\in P\\,(p\\le q\\land q\\le p\\to p=q))\\land(\\forall p,q,r\\in P\\,(p\\le q\\land q\\le r\\to p\\le r))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-relation","status":"resolved","id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\le","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartOrd}(P, \\le)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}order} \\vdash \\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,\\le) \\leftrightarrow \\le\\,\\subseteq P\\times P\\land(\\forall p\\in P\\,(p\\le p))\\land(\\forall p,q\\in P\\,(p\\le q\\land q\\le p\\to p=q))\\land(\\forall p,q,r\\in P\\,(p\\le q\\land q\\le r\\to p\\le r))","display":true}],"bytes":674,"backlinks":[{"id":"1aff2ee432333e82","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P,\\leq_P,M,m,x,C,b\\in V$, with $\\mathrm{PartOrd}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$, $\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P$, and $\\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,\\leq_P)$ (see [[../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md]])"},{"id":"790ab4ebab659823","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartOrd}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md]])"},{"id":"68353af5ed159f6f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,\\leq)$ (partial-order predicate, see [[../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md]])"},{"id":"ab96223acaba295d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"若要求这些性质，参见 [[../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md]] 和 [[../batch20/58-df-total-order.md]]"},{"id":"e28385785e6b2872","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartOrd}\\subseteq V^2$ (partial-order predicate, see [[../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md]])"},{"id":"c35dc6c3143a8724","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartOrd}\\subseteq V^2$ (partial-order predicate, see [[../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md]])"},{"id":"25b9260c94f77a3a","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0420a8db402fa6fa","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c191af7b1546da5d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c9b9175a5a31065e","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d157fafacb05a82b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"80dbe7889a8e7dea","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"309e6b4c626877fe","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5fe34b1ba3bc153e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,\\leq)$ (partial-order predicate, see [[58-df-partial-order]])"},{"id":"9cb9b7f106aade8c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(P,\\leq_P),(Q,\\leq_Q)$ (partial orders, see [[../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md]])"},{"id":"d413862f4ab047c8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartOrd}$ (partial-order predi